OL,3,GNEWSABailiff does not regret allowing
OL,4,Aextra amendments
OL,5,
OL,6,FGuernsey's new bailiff said she does
OL,7,Fnot regret allowing new amendments to
OL,8,Fbe submitted in the States tax reform
OL,9,Fdebate, despite frustration from
OL,10,Fdeputies.
OL,12,FJessica Roland succeeded Sir Richard
OL,13,FMcMahon to become Guernsey's first
OL,14,Ffemale bailiff on Thursday and will
OL,15,Foversee the continued tax talks next
OL,16,Fweek.
OL,18,FAnother 40 out of 57 amendments to the
OL,19,FPolicy and Resources (P&R) proposals
OL,20,Fare yet to be discussed after Roland
OL,21,Fallowed deputies to submit changes
OL,22,Ffollowing the July debate.
OL,23,APub: 26-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
