OL,3,GNEWSABailiff does not regret allowing
OL,4,Aextra amendments
OL,5,
OL,6,FAsked about the move to reopen the
OL,7,Fwindow, she said "it was the right
OL,8,Fdecision" and insisted it was not one
OL,9,Fshe regretted.
